WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,360
Immortality

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:02,740
What Bai Jingshan said

3
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,100
Damn he's still alive

4
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:11,820
It's been decades

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,180
What did they eat to survive?

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,780
This place is not for dogs

7
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:18,100
It's a living testing ground for little devils. Who cares what he is.

8
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,540
If you tell me whether you can become a sperm after you put it down, don’t beat me randomly.

9
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,980
He covered his face and hit them on both sides.

10
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,140
Leave the middle end to me

11
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:27,350
Brothers open fire

12
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:37,500
If you can't blind him, he's not in pain. Don't talk about beating him.

13
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,700
The bullets are all embedded in the flesh.
